    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University (AKU) recently hosted a high-level delegation from the Ministry of Health, Tanzania, led by Dr Grace Magembe, Chief Medical Officer. The visit to AKU's Pakistan campus underscored a shared commitment to advancing health and education in Tanzania through strategic collaboration.",
